# Profile and Help & Support. Works with any signed-in role (TOURIST, PARTNER_*, DRIVER); ticket queue is ADMIN.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@ticketId = PASTE_TICKET_ID
@bookingId = PASTE_BOOKING_ID

### My profile
GET {{base}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### Update my profile (only supplied fields change; an empty email clears it)
PUT {{base}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Asha Das",
  "email": "asha@example.com",
  "preferredLanguage": "or"
}

### Raise a support ticket (bookingId is optional and must be your own booking)
# category: BOOKING_ISSUE | PAYMENT_ISSUE | DRIVER_ISSUE | CANCELLATION_REFUND | SAFETY | OTHER
POST {{base}}/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "BOOKING_ISSUE",
  "subject": "Driver went to the wrong pickup",
  "description": "The driver waited at Gate 2 instead of Gate 4.",
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}"
}

### My tickets
GET {{base}}/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### One ticket with its conversation
GET {{base}}/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### Reply (admins may reply too; replying to a resolved ticket reopens it)
POST {{base}}/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Thanks, this is still happening."
}

### ADMIN: ticket queue (?status=OPEN|IN_PROGRESS|RESOLVED|CLOSED)
GET {{base}}/admin/support/tickets?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### ADMIN: take it / resolve / close
POST {{base}}/admin/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

###
POST {{base}}/admin/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

###
POST {{base}}/admin/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
